Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:02.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,What if your slides could present themselves…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,…and answer questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:06.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Meet SlideSpoken. Upload your deck—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,—or create one with AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:12.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,An AI Presenter delivers it live—in the room,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:15.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,or on Google Meet, Zoom and Teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:18.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,HR teams train new hires.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:21.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Real estate agents pitch properties to investors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:25.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Sales teams run product demos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:27.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Educators turn lessons into conversations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:30.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ask a question. SlideSpoken answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:33.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,then picks up right where it left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Stop just sharing slides. Let them speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:39.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Start free at SlideSpoken.com.
